                    "linkColor": "#514293",
                    "linkHoverColor": "#514293",
                    "linkUnderline": true,
                    "linkHoverUnderline": true
                  },
                  "text": "Thanks for joining us, and welcome to our community.<br><br>When I started House &amp; Hearth from an empty flat years ago, the mission was simple: help people make their homes more beautiful, organised and healthy. We still do that today.<br><br>We’re now a bigger team of editors, photographers and designers, all working to put out useful, inspiring writing every day.<br><br>We’re still building something special, and still trying to improve the world one room at a time.",
                  "fontSize": "15px",
                  "fontFamily": {
                    "label": "Helvetica",
                    "value": "helvetica,sans-serif"
                  },
                  "color": "#555555",
                  "textAlign": "left",
                  "lineHeight": "160%",
                  "containerPadding": "8px 56px 16px"
